# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is git-ignored; .env.example is not.
#
# Publisher signing key: 64 lowercase hex characters (a 32-byte secp256k1 scalar).
# Used by `tvc register` to sign the registration payload that binds a model's
# weight commitment to the publishing lab's identity.
#
# The corresponding x-only public key is the lab's entire public identity. A
# consumer pins that public key and calls `tvc verify --publisher <pubkey>`;
# anyone holding the secret key can sign registrations under that identity for
# any model, so it is the whole of what needs protecting.
#
# Generate with:  cargo run --bin tvc -- keygen
TVC_SECRET_KEY=
